      "name": "dsh-nudge",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH Nudge",
        "zh": "DSH 轻推提醒"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Bottom-right desktop card when a session turn completes, needs a choice (approval / question), or fails. Topmost, never steals focus, auto-dismisses; click jumps back to the harness and copies the batch, and both of those can be turned off — optionally the card becomes a pure hint that mouse clicks pass straight through.",
        "zh": "会话回合完成、需要你选择（审批 / 提问）或执行失败时，在 Windows 桌面右下角弹一张置顶卡片：不抢焦点、自动消失。默认点击回到 DSH 并把这批提醒复制到剪贴板；这两件事都能关掉，还可以让整张卡鼠标穿透，只当提示、点到后面的窗口。"
      },
